  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">注意：我已经在着手处理宝箱战利品，以及即将推出的新更新，该更新将为游戏添加5个新宝箱。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Cobblemon：简易宝可梦中心</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>◽ 功能版本（支持 Cobblemon）：1.20.1 / 1.21.1<br>◽ 装饰版本：1.21.2 / 1.21.3 / 1.21.4</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>◽ 你是否曾在旅途中途，却无处治愈你的宝可梦？</strong><br><strong>◽ 这是一个简单的模组，添加了带有浆果、治疗机器和电脑的宝可梦中心。<br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>◽ 若要配置建筑之间的生成距离，你需要打开模组的“Jar”文件，前往 -&gt; <span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\">data/cobblemon_simple_center/worldgen/structure_set/pokecenter.json</span>。在里面修改<span style=\"color: #ba372a;\">‘spacing’</span>和<span style=\"color: #ba372a;\">“separation”</span>。<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>◽ 若要配置建筑出现的生物群系，你需要打开模组的“Jar”文件，前往 -&gt; <span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\">data/cobblemon_simple_center/tags/worldgen/biome/has_structure/pokecenter.json</span>。在里面根据标签修改生物群系，例如 <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\">#c:is_forest</span>。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>我的其他模组：</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><a style=\"color: #e03e2d;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-create-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Create：Cobblemon 工业</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-additions-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Cobblemon：武器、护甲与工具</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><a style=\"color: #e03e2d;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-additions-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Cobblemon：宝可梦实验室</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><a style=\"color: #e03e2d;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-botany-pots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Cobblemon：植物盆栽</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><a style=\"color: #e03e2d;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemore-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Cobblemore 库</a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f4b8a61e-6475-4bb5-ad4b-c00841ef365f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4dce2554-8143-4483-a779-699fb0e86fe8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>模型致谢：<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/styrix/\" rel=\"nofollow\">@styrix</a></h3>",
